**Insight:** `/analytics` (`?tab=overview|sales|lead-sources|receiver-agents|text-to-booked|geography|cancellations`), `/reports/agent-sales`

**Ops:** `/observational` (`?tab=overview|events|incidents|reports|notifications|sheet-sync`; Health deep-link is `GRANOT_LIFECYCLE_HEALTH_HREF`), `/operations-registry` (`?tab=overview|agents|merchants|lead-sources|granot-names|inbound-numbers|moving-carriers|lead-costs|legacy-cpl|changes`; old `sources` / `granot-sources` / `ringcentral` / `cpl` still redirect), `/ingestion` (Best Relocation, Deprecated badge + `INGESTION_COPY` warning), `/ingestion/granot` (owner HTTP Automation), `/granot-lifecycle` and `/granot-lifecycle/receipts` (Owner Receipts search), `/granot-lifecycle/health` (Owner/Admin), `/live-events` (Owner live Granot webhook SSE), `/intakes` (owner Booking/Cancellation cases), `/ingestion/granot/lifecycle/cases/[caseId]` (no redirect), `/ingestion/granot/lifecycle/discrepancies` (no redirect), `/reporting`, `/reporting/[id]`, `/reporting/destinations`, `/reporting/destinations/[id]`, `/reporting/runs/[id]`. Old `/ingestion/granot/lifecycle` → `/intakes`; `/ingestion/granot/lifecycle/health` → `/granot-lifecycle/health`; `/ingestion/granot/lifecycle/jobs/:jobNo` → `/job-timeline?job=`. `intakeJobHref` is `/job-timeline?job=`. **GLS-03 shipped:** Receipts is the Granot Lifecycle default. Contract: `vantage-main-server/docs/granot-lifecycle-surfaces/`.

**Support:** `/search`, `/exports`, `/audit-log` (owner), `/extension` (owner create Extension User). `/settings` permanently redirects to `/operations-registry?tab=moving-carriers` (`next.config.ts` + `settings/page.tsx`) and is not owner-only.

**Public:** `/employee-booking`, `/privacy-policy`, `/terms-and-conditions`

- Prefer extending `operational-resource-page` config before forking model pages.
- The Operational / Insight / Ops / Support headings above are the route surface, not the sidebar groups (Today / Records / People / Insight / System in `dashboard-nav.tsx`).
- Scope controls live in `components/layout/scope-aware-header-controls.tsx`; coerce `combined` before detail fetches.
- Historical scope is read-only; hide mutations. No delete UI in any scope unless an explicit owner-only observability delete path already exists.

